    <string name="menu_msaa_help">Smooths the jagged edges of the 3D world. 4× costs more on weaker GPUs.</string>
    <string name="menu_msaa_none">This GPU does not offer this anti-aliasing.</string>
    <string name="menu_dof">Depth of field</string>
    <string name="menu_dof_help">Focuses on what the crosshair points at and softly blurs the distance behind it; the weapon, the HUD and the menus stay sharp. The slider beside it sets how strongly (50 % by default). Costs some performance.</string>
    <string name="menu_fxaa">FXAA</string>
    <string name="menu_fxaa_help">Smooths jagged edges in a last step. Works with or without MSAA; the picture gets slightly softer, the HUD stays sharp.</string>
